  "renderedTitle": "Galactic coordinate",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Galactic coordinate includes few ranks: <a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_i&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate i (page does not exist)\">I</a>, <a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_ii&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate ii (page does not exist)\">II</a>, <a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_iii&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate iii (page does not exist)\">III</a>, <a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_iv&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate iv (page does not exist)\">IV</a> and <a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_v&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate v (page does not exist)\">V</a>.\n</p><p>You cost this when you go on <a href=\"/index.php/Galactic_Expedition\" title=\"Galactic Expedition\">galactic expeditions</a>. This can be collected by <a href=\"/index.php/Research\" title=\"Research\">researching</a>.\n</p><p>Different difficulty on the galactic expeditions has different value, all shown in the table below.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Difficulty\n</th>\n<th>Galactic Coordinate\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/index.php/Rocket_fuel\" title=\"Rocket fuel\">Rocket fuel</a>\n</th>\n<th>Success chance -- Base value\n</th>\n<th>Damage on Failure (<a href=\"/index.php?title=Space_station_parts&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Space station parts (page does not exist)\">Space station parts</a>)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I (1)</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_i&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate i (page does not exist)\">Galactic Coordinate I</a></td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II (2)</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_ii&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate ii (page does not exist)\">Galactic Coordinate II</a></td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n<td>200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III (3)</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_iii&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate iii (page does not exist)\">Galactic Coordinate III</a></td>\n<td>300</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>300\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV (4)</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_iv&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate iv (page does not exist)\">Galactic Coordinate IV</a></td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V (5)</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php?title=Galactic_coordinate_v&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Galactic coordinate v (page does not exist)\">Galactic Coordinate V</a></td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>500\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Every level of expeditions all cost same value of coordinate (1) and <a href=\"/index.php/Rocket\" title=\"Rocket\">rocket</a> (1).\n</p><p>Failure may either give you the rocket back or the rocket having a chance to be destroyed.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009145614\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:268-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009145614 and revision id 1668\n -->\n</div>",
